  "VIX bracket 2026-12-24 (27.0 d) / 2027-01-22 (56.0 d) is not Cboe's: Cboe's near and next terms have more than 23 and fewer than 37 days to expiration, and the stored chain lacks the candidate expiry 2026-12-31 (34.0 d); the level interpolates a wider bracket."
